---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {
  featuredPosters,
  morePosters,
  officialPoster,
} from '../data/posters';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Boeing 747 Flight Attendant Movie Posters | Golden Wings: Stewardess to Sky Queen"
  description="A Boeing 747 flight attendant with 54 years in the sky gets reimagined through iconic movie posters. Discover the story behind Golden Wings."
  path="/poster"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container prose">
      <span class="eyebrow">Poster countdown</span>
      <h1>What Happens When a Boeing 747 Meets the Most Iconic Movie Posters Ever Made</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        If you've ever wondered what it felt like to step aboard a Boeing 747 during the golden age
        of aviation, you're not alone. The upper deck lounge. The real china. The bar at 35,000
        feet. That world is gone now, but one flight attendant never left it behind.
      </p>
      <p>
        Robyn Stewart has been flying with American Airlines for fifty-four years. She was there
        when the Boeing 747 cabin was the most glamorous room in the sky. She served cocktails on
        the upper deck, handed out meals on porcelain, and watched the world change from the jump
        seat of the most iconic aircraft ever built.
      </p>
      <p>
        Her son made a documentary about it. It's called
        <em>Golden Wings: Stewardess to Sky Queen</em>. And right now, we're counting down to the
        release of the official 2026 poster in the most ridiculous way possible: by reimagining the
        film through the lens of some of the most iconic movie posters ever made.
      </p>
      <p>Here's what's happened so far.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider" />

  {
    featuredPosters.map((poster, index) => (
      <section
        class:list={['section', 'poster-feature', index % 2 === 1 && 'poster-feature--flip']}
        id={poster.id}
        aria-labelledby={`${poster.id}-heading`}
      >
        <div class="container poster-feature__grid">
          <figure class="poster-feature__frame">
            <img
              src={poster.image}
              alt={poster.alt}
              width="800"
              height="1200"
              loading={index < 2 ? 'eager' : 'lazy'}
              decoding="async"
            />
          </figure>
          <div class="poster-feature__copy prose">
            <span class="eyebrow">Featured {String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <h2 id={`${poster.id}-heading`}>{poster.title}</h2>
            {poster.paragraphs.map((para) => (
              <p>{para}</p>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    ))
  }

  <hr class="divider" />

  <section class="section poster-closing" aria-labelledby="closing-heading">
    <div class="container poster-closing__grid">
      <figure class="poster-feature__frame poster-closing__art">
        <img
          src={officialPoster.image}
          alt={officialPoster.alt}
          width="800"
          height="1000"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </figure>
      <div class="prose">
        <span class="eyebrow">Official key art</span>
        <h2 id="closing-heading">The Story Behind the Boeing 747 Movie Posters</h2>
        <p>
          Every poster in this series features the same aircraft: the American Airlines Boeing 747,
          in its classic silver fuselage with the red, white, and blue stripe livery. It was the
          plane that changed everything. The Boeing 747 cabin wasn't just transportation. It was an
          experience. A bar on the upper deck. Meals served on real china. Flight attendants who
          treated every passenger like a guest in their home.
        </p>
        <p>
          Robyn Stewart lived that life for fifty-four years. Jock Bethune, known across the airline
          as "Mr. American Airlines," helped build the training programs that made the Boeing 747
          era possible. Their stories are the heart of
          <em>Golden Wings: Stewardess to Sky Queen</em>.
        </p>
        <p>
          We're still counting down. More posters are coming. And the real poster, no gimmicks, no
          genre, just the story, is waiting at the end.
        </p>
        <p class="muted">
          <em>Golden Wings: Stewardess to Sky Queen</em> is a documentary by Caleb Mills Stewart.
          Follow the countdown and be the first to see the official 2026 poster.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href={officialPoster.download} download>
            Download official key art
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/watch">Watch</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider" />

  <section class="section poster-gallery" aria-labelledby="more-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Gallery coda</span>
      <h2 id="more-heading">More from the series</h2>
      <p class="muted poster-gallery__lede">
        The rest of the countdown: more parody one-sheets from the same Boeing 747 flight path.
      </p>
      <ul class="poster-gallery__grid">
        {
          morePosters.map((poster) => (
            <li>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="poster-gallery__thumb"
                data-lightbox-src={poster.image}
                data-lightbox-alt={poster.alt}
                aria-label={`Open ${poster.title} poster`}
              >
                <img
                  src={poster.image}
                  alt={poster.alt}
                  width="400"
                  height="600"
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                />
                <span class="poster-gallery__caption">{poster.title}</span>
              </button>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <dialog class="poster-lightbox" id="poster-lightbox" aria-label="Poster preview">
    <form method="dialog" class="poster-lightbox__bar">
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-ghost" value="close">Close</button>
    </form>
    <img src="" alt="" class="poster-lightbox__img" width="900" height="1350" />
  </dialog>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const dialog = document.getElementById('poster-lightbox') as HTMLDialogElement | null;
  const img = dialog?.querySelector('.poster-lightbox__img') as HTMLImageElement | null;
  if (dialog && img) {
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.poster-gallery__thumb').forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const src = btn.dataset.lightboxSrc;
        const alt = btn.dataset.lightboxAlt ?? '';
        if (!src) return;
        img.src = src;
        img.alt = alt;
        dialog.showModal();
      });
    });
    dialog.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
      if (event.target === dialog) dialog.close();
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .poster-feature__grid,
  .poster-closing__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 56rem) {
    .poster-feature__grid,
    .poster-closing__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 22rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-7);
    }

    .poster-feature--flip .poster-feature__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(12rem, 22rem);
    }

    .poster-feature--flip .poster-feature__frame {
      order: 2;
    }

    .poster-feature--flip .poster-feature__copy {
      order: 1;
    }
  }

  .poster-feature__frame {
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--wing-gold) 72%, var(--mist-line));
    background: var(--color-bg-elevated);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb, var(--wing-gold) 25%, transparent),
      0 1.25rem 2.5rem color-mix(in srgb, var(--night-black) 55%, transparent);
    aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;
    max-width: 22rem;
    width: 100%;
    justify-self: center;
  }

  .poster-feature__frame img,
  .poster-gallery__thumb img,
  .poster-lightbox__img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .poster-feature__copy {
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .poster-closing__art {
    max-width: 20rem;
  }

  .poster-gallery__lede {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .poster-gallery__grid {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(9.5rem, 1fr));
  }

  .poster-gallery__thumb {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .poster-gallery__thumb img {
    aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--wing-gold) 45%, var(--mist-line));
    background: var(--color-bg-elevated);
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .poster-gallery__thumb:hover img,
  .poster-gallery__thumb:focus-visible img {
    border-color: var(--wing-gold);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .poster-gallery__caption {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--soft-ivory);
  }

  .poster-lightbox {
    max-width: min(28rem, calc(100vw - 2rem));
    padding: var(--space-4);
    border: 1px solid var(--mist-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--runway-ink);
    color: var(--cloud-white);
  }

  .poster-lightbox::backdrop {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--night-black) 78%, transparent);
  }

  .poster-lightbox__bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .poster-lightbox__img {
    aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--wing-gold) 55%, var(--mist-line));
  }
</style>
